Licensing for this repository
=============================

1. Vendored skills — MIT License
--------------------------------

Portions of the plugins in this repository are vendored, word for word or as
audited adaptations, from https://github.com/mattpocock/skills at the commit
pinned in each plugin's lock.md. Today that covers, under
.claude/skills/product/skills/: triage (and its AGENT-BRIEF.md and
OUT-OF-SCOPE.md), refine (from wayfinder), research, grilling, prototype (and
its LOGIC.md and UI.md), domain-modeling (and its ADR-FORMAT.md and
CONTEXT-FORMAT.md), and the flow-map structure of ask (from ask-matt).
Per-file provenance, including every drift from the upstream text, is recorded
in each plugin's lock.md.

